# PR self-review

When preparing a PR:

1. `node .claude/skills/pr-self-review/scripts/review.mjs origin/main...HEAD`
2. Walk `.claude/skills/pr-self-review/references/checklist.md`
3. Build claims ledger + blast radius + failure paths + a11y notes
4. Report 🔴/🟡/🟢 with verdict; **do not auto-fix** until the user says yes

Also available as skill `pr-self-review` under `.cursor/skills/`.
